<title>JAPAN: Satori Electric plans share split.</title>
<headline>Satori Electric plans share split.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Satori Electric Co Ltd said on Monday it planned a 1.2-for-1 share split on July 18, for shareholders as of May 31.</p>
